{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "34d4c930fc63871fe853168815cb63c655a804b053a8f8b0ab1a6a51617d283d", "ja": "どんな服を着て行こうかな……そうだ！　この前買った\n新しいカバン、おろしちゃおうかな？　えへへっ♪", "zh": "穿什么衣服去好呢……对了！要不要把前几天买的新包包拿出来用呢？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7fe416bdc613a26e4ae1a31d687f6e570a488f7e0bd385b7f6d289f41ed4f683", "ja": "青羽さん。お疲れさまです！\nなんだか楽しそうですね。何かありましたか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了！\n感觉你好像很开心。发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "31d34e1464732f6f925c585d9efad8f03aeaa171d24e78fd737e6165a18e2fe1", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "903a98dc5018b5e11ae07955c08f3059a963f6cc8e503982decb916482fffa65", "ja": "今度、音無先輩とお買い物に行くんです！\nお買い物って、なんだかウキウキしちゃいますよね♪", "zh": "下次我要和音无前辈一起去购物！\n一说到购物，就总让人忍不住兴奋起来呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3009bcf3715af0450481c4b217fc7b1a3d9dee339539128ba3deb01f9b5bde47", "ja": "買い物ですか。いいなあ。\n欲しい物を探して歩くのは楽しいですよね。", "zh": "买东西啊。真好。四处走走，寻找自己想要的东西，很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "c118721d8868cac74a23e3b1b08fb0e8aadb6d7887c190e558918cb04770d774", "ja": "はいっ。冒険しているみたいに楽しくて、\n旅行の前の日みたいなワクワク感も……ああっ！", "zh": "是的！就像在冒险一样开心，还有种旅行前一天那样的兴奋感……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "1d955d69f644da50ac1ab30d4fd036701440a82371289560e548e5b6491249bb", "ja": "そうでした！　社長さんがお呼びでした！\nなんでも、トラベルなお話があるとか言ってましたよ。", "zh": "对了！社长叫您过去！\n好像说有关于旅行的事情要谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6e59f0f32023dc962b4c55f5a33efc8830ad3d1a4a2c633581cef7300f4c85f9", "ja": "トラベルな話？　なんだろうな……。\nさっそく、事務所に行ってみますね！", "zh": "关于旅行的事？会是什么呢……我这就去事务所看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "4794f6237905aa7dfb3a68f68a10fd30e098c93e4476f30300b2c0a8cb4418d7", "ja": "はーいっ！　気をつけていってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好——！路上小心，慢走哦——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f319db527669edf656cc397173436724ac0b2cac6e5ca61f863ab7c6a951042b", "ja": "失礼します。\n社長、音無さん、お疲れ様です！", "zh": "打扰了。\n社长、音无小姐，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "ecde3b28bad17aa167d7c69bb1b2b2668ea2d35aa06c0f7467ecec9e922b5154", "ja": "おお君、来てくれたか！\nいやいや……忙しいところ、ご苦労だったね。", "zh": "哦，你来了啊！\n不不……百忙之中，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "b21e902d409303f2bc76a110ee2e3d38f1c3c3062589e0389f605efcd16bc47c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様です♪\n今、お茶を淹れてきますね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了♪\n我现在去泡茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0b4cb25fd17145b80ed589d8fc18fbef3b8152d0d5f2feb69db030315dd5645e", "ja": "それで社長、お話というのは……。\n青羽さんから、トラベルな話？と聞いたのですが。", "zh": "那么，社长，您说要谈的事情是……？\n我听青羽小姐说，是关于旅行的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "8b34c218f2fdbca2bfa5e2da95a2e6cf7c2183034c17e26ef9930f5bd47728d7", "ja": "うむ。単刀直入に言うと、\nそろそろ地方公演の時期ではないかと思ってね。", "zh": "嗯。直截了当地说，\n我觉得差不多该举办地方公演了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "af2c39937a8263b65efa45c56749664de22b1c7feca1fdab57811c3464bf437e", "ja": "候補地は既に何箇所かあるんだが……今回は、\n君とアイドル諸君の直感に任せようと思っている。", "zh": "候选地点已经有好几个了……不过这次，我打算交给你和各位偶像的直觉来决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "200396616e94f5dfcdcf5b605d92e52e79376f123bfda1206cdc7707288e0a63", "ja": "なるほど、地方公演のお話でしたか。\nしかし、こちらで決めてしまってもいいんでしょうか？", "zh": "原来是地方公演的事啊。\n不过，由我们来决定真的可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "376daacb6100eb6bcc2612c0c8c95a642d19c770c9907f88e6492c59cddcd516", "ja": "もちろんだとも！　君とアイドル諸君なら、\nどんな土地でも素晴らしい公演にしてくれるだろう？", "zh": "当然！有你和偶像们在，无论身处何地，都能为大家带来精彩的公演吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "c75b19a5c691987d66056c1ad4ab36a29ad28bcccaedf7991f743f2f0e62ad7d", "ja": "そうそう。公演の目玉に、新しい曲を用意したんだよ。\nおーい、音無君！", "zh": "对了对了。为了让演出更有看头，我准备了一首新歌。\n喂，音无！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "b9b2e75c3334776dfa98e87fd2af9b6eedf77aef378a95ed3eea89ac39b8dd4b", "ja": "はい、{$P$}さん。お茶をどうぞ。\n新曲って、さっき聞いた曲ですよね？", "zh": "好的，{$P$}先生。请喝茶。\n新歌就是刚才听到的那首吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "a4def52954b94fe725897f9b98966a349b6a84a42868c1a3878cdc4027324360", "ja": "ウキウキするような楽しい曲なんですよ♪\nそれでは流しますね……ポチッ！", "zh": "是一首让人心情雀跃的欢快歌曲哦♪\n那么现在播放……按下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d0329f06e645969ac07f114009a8cdf82eca394f1b8a5f0c3d6f67f0f8de0bcb", "ja": "おお！　すごく素敵な曲ですね！\nこの曲に合うアイドルは……うん。", "zh": "哦哦！真是一首非常棒的歌啊！\n适合这首歌的偶像是……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "db3d8f42b5570cfa7747221d432a2029ebeb6a9c65fcee81251e1ba2ba231cc0", "ja": "ははっ、君の中には歌唱するメンバーが浮かんでいる\nようだね。よしっ、メンバーの人選も君に任せよう！", "zh": "哈哈，看来你心里已经有要演唱的成员了\n好，就连成员人选也交给你来决定吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1024_101kot", "source_sha256": "1d067c188d46303f343a546d0b49d8585352c8a3b0821ce1f3bc416740a15f4d", "ja": "ふふっ、頼もしいですね。\nちなみに……どんなメンバーになりそうですか？", "zh": "呵呵，真是可靠呢。\n顺便问一下……你觉得会选出什么样的成员呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "38b897d8f9346d8a08b99868d561c6701ae46ee9bff12ef151ed38f75364bbd2", "ja": "はい。元気で明るく、弾むような勢いのあるメンバーが\nこの曲には合うんじゃないかなと。", "zh": "是的。我觉得充满活力、开朗阳光、气势如同跃动般的成员，应该很适合这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "ced105b6978d2c88d5509ef2992f1332979cd21fa6269d6b15fac3b0adf03cbe", "ja": "すぐにイメージを固めるなんて、\n君もなかなかの名プロデューサーだね。はっはっは！", "zh": "这么快就确定形象了，\n你也是相当出色的制作人呢。哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1027_president", "source_sha256": "6e34b34342ccb8ebe0e64b06f7705eda2dd97fa4bb08c8930cb248a97fbbf69d", "ja": "君が頑張ってくれていることは、私も音無君も、\nもちろん、アイドル諸君にも伝わっているはずだ。", "zh": "你的努力，我和音无，\n当然还有各位偶像，肯定都看在眼里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "66063bc4bb5469707560907cb44a861787c736242d7f752adcd7675b5f21bd03", "ja": "私も微力ながら、お手伝いしますからね！\nあっ、そうだ。あの……{$P$}さん？", "zh": "我也会尽绵薄之力帮忙的！啊，对了。那个……{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "148a63b0af6fd842eedac017362263dec59938d9b360bcdff1b991f2c48a5357", "ja": "えっと、その……なんと言いますか……\nたまには、私も……。", "zh": "那个……该怎么说呢……\n偶尔，我也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "42ef4cde9b65802759536fe0191882396b28b1308c2302ad810aea6ab4b4d781", "ja": "あっ。わかりました、お土産ですね？\n任せてください、美味しいのを選んできますね！", "zh": "啊，我明白了，是要买伴手礼吧？\n交给我吧，我会挑些好吃的回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1031_101kot", "source_sha256": "306205919a77afa31dddc9b1e18307b72f7f6009719c0d59209e1f1b6aec71a6", "ja": "えっ？　そういうことじゃ……\nいえ、お土産も楽しみですけど……！", "zh": "诶？不是那个意思……\n不，我也很期待伴手礼啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0150_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0150_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "00abbb2c2dc50065fdf2ef897b3705ef881b9fe61fdc07229113cced929561a6", "ja": "（久しぶりの地方公演だから、成功させないと！\nきっとあのメンバーなら期待に応えてくれるはずだ）", "zh": "（因为是久违的地方公演，必须要成功！我相信那群成员一定能回应期待。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
